    COMPUTER\n\n3. VERIFY:\n   - NAME\n   - EMPLOYEE ID\n   - DEPARTMENT\n   - CLEARANCE\n\n4.
    CLEAR VALID PERSONNEL.\n\n5. DENY INVALID PERSONNEL.\n\n6. CLEARED PERSONNEL
    MUST BE\n   CONFIRMED AT THE FACILITY ENTRANCE\n   BEFORE UNLOCKING THE DOOR.\n\nDO
    NOT ADMIT UNVERIFIED PERSONNEL.\n\nPRESS E TO PUT DOWN"
